@host = http://localhost:5103

### Place a click & collect order -> 202 Accepted (reservation happens async via RabbitMQ)
# @name place
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeId": "STORE-001",
  "customerName": "Alex Walker",
  "customerEmail": "alex@example.com",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "BC-JKT-001", "quantity": 1 },
    { "sku": "BC-SOCK-001", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Poll the order: Submitted -> ReadyToPick (or Rejected) within ~1s
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{place.response.body.id}}

### Store pick list
GET {{host}}/api/orders?storeId=STORE-001&status=ReadyToPick

### Mark picked (handheld) - idempotent, call twice
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{place.response.body.id}}/picked

### Customer collected
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{place.response.body.id}}/collected
